# Unreal build output and caches
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
Build/
Plugins/*/Binaries/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb

# Core library builds
Core/build*/

# Story text stays out of this public repo (CLAUDE.md). Copy it from newengine assets/story.
Data/Story/
# Voice lines speak the story, so their audio, lip-sync tracks and imported assets stay out too.
Data/Voice/
Content/Voice/
# The windows' room and curtain atlases are private art, and the window master and instances reference them.
Content/Rendering/Windows/

# Python bytecode (Blender scripts)
__pycache__/

# Local config overrides (e.g. which private character the explore pawn wears)
Config/User*.ini

# Marketplace content claimed by the user: local only, never committed
Content/Fab/

# The Solhaven strip is built by FTBuildMassingWorld from the plan's tables (docs/WORLDS.md): a build product
Content/Maps/World_Solhaven_Strip.umap
